{"steam_appid":1555150,"steam_name":"Pocket Bravery","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1555150/603020/ae4045639a876d3d16200a8fc9ac2e444aa7ac83/1751002646/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1693485162","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/256967002/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1693485162","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1555150/ss_f11f190b39712d6085f88d450be0764b1b21c4f5.1920x1080.jpg?t=1779799747","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1555150/ss_6277529a07fab12664877e48575e0d208ab30e2a.1920x1080.jpg?t=1779799747","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1555150/ss_c70af5e19b9eb8fdc5c088a14185ae0503b6306a.1920x1080.jpg?t=1779799747","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1555150/ss_8c8e1f5c9ea4c5275323ca73914496c93bbe8ed6.1920x1080.jpg?t=1779799747","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1555150/ss_c0e799c0ae6a375fa8be7933b578666d6c63741c.1920x1080.jpg?t=1779799747"],"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Inspired by classic fighting games from the 90's such as Street Fighter, Fatal Fury and The King of Fighters, 'Pocket Bravery' channels the 'Neo Geo Pocket' aesthetic for a modern fighting game with a retro twist!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1555150/extras/074adfd92a52bc39e8537ea06b6e465d.poster.avif?t=1779799747\" width=610 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1555150/extras/074adfd92a52bc39e8537ea06b6e465d.webm?t=1779799747\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1555150/extras/074adfd92a52bc39e8537ea06b6e465d.mp4?t=1779799747\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With original characters, vibrant colours and an impressive combat system, 'Pocket Bravery' is designed with high-level players in mind, while making it easily accessible for beginners to pick-up-and-play! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1555150/extras/13c51b12321a054114259dcf66e58fe9.poster.avif?t=1779799747\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1555150/extras/13c51b12321a054114259dcf66e58fe9.webm?t=1779799747\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1555150/extras/13c51b12321a054114259dcf66e58fe9.mp4?t=1779799747\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choose Your Fighter! </strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Select from a diverse 12 character roster, each with their own unique abilities and play styles! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1555150/extras/f6c523e923ef2c6bfccf04476ff6598e.poster.avif?t=1779799747\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1555150/extras/f6c523e923ef2c6bfccf04476ff6598e.webm?t=1779799747\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1555150/extras/f6c523e923ef2c6bfccf04476ff6598e.mp4?t=1779799747\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Local and Online Multiplayer with 'Rollback Netcode </strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clash head-to-head worldwide with ultra-low latency rollback code in online multiplayer or take on your friends locally! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1555150/extras/cdb4a80e254d575697fc18f43543b20a.poster.avif?t=1779799747\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1555150/extras/cdb4a80e254d575697fc18f43543b20a.webm?t=1779799747\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1555150/extras/cdb4a80e254d575697fc18f43543b20a.mp4?t=1779799747\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Master An Elemental-Based Combat System </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Channel your inner 'Ichor', a unique elemental energy blessing each one of the playable characters in Pocket Bravery. Master the elements to open up new  offensive or defensive possibilities!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1555150/extras/de25b7b41ee35264ce39f9f8794eb64c.poster.avif?t=1779799747\" width=610 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1555150/extras/de25b7b41ee35264ce39f9f8794eb64c.webm?t=1779799747\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1555150/extras/de25b7b41ee35264ce39f9f8794eb64c.mp4?t=1779799747\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unleash Screen-Filling Ultimate Attacks!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Charge up to unleash your ultimate attack!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1555150/extras/930a32d93f9114dbb966ec8a0c087a80.poster.avif?t=1779799747\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1555150/extras/930a32d93f9114dbb966ec8a0c087a80.webm?t=1779799747\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1555150/extras/930a32d93f9114dbb966ec8a0c087a80.mp4?t=1779799747\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 or newer<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-540 or AMD Phenom II X2 550<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GT 620, 1 GB or AMD Radeon HD 6570, 1 GB or Intel HD Graphics 530<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 16 GB available space</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 or newer<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core Core i7-4790<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 970, 4 GB<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 16 GB available space</li></ul>","genres":["Action","Indie"],"developers":["Statera Studio"],"publishers":["PQube"],"release_date":"31 Aug, 2023","metacritic_score":74}